{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf2aca5ce0fa74069aa7dfc80de6476099adff633bea466ac9da965e2f6fa10f", "ja": "ロコ、お疲れさま。ブログ読んだぞ。\nなんか色々考えてるみたいだな。", "zh": "ROCO，辛苦了。我看过博客了。\n感觉你似乎考虑了很多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
