{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0194_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "0e7a58b280470355c41afe493e2fea41f502042dceb712448b80e1e84360b79e", "ja": "ポイントは、多様性ですよ♪\nパーソナリティのエクスプレッションです～！", "zh": "重点在于多样性哦♪\n这是个性的表达～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0194_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "2b46edfee37c375f01aacda4a7fa91dda0392ac24eaa72be461a9e0dc43f05ff", "ja": "ロコはスポーツが苦手ですけど、アイドルとしては\nそれも個性ですから！　そういうことです。", "zh": "ROCO虽然不擅长运动，但作为偶像，这也是个性嘛！\n就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0194_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b518ec5929d9bc705a23213f7ea11f80433cdb38e9cceffb196b56d831a03be3", "ja": "なるほど、欠点に見えるところも、個性って事か。\nでも、運動はもうちょっと頑張ってもらいたいけど。", "zh": "原来如此，看起来像缺点的地方，也能算是个性啊。\n不过，运动方面还是希望你能再努力一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0194_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "8a9942c5fb45f177405874b9b0d5043cbf21cff71230a8b84524e562dc5d35cc", "ja": "うっ、それはまあ、そのうち……。\nと、とにかくロコは、お礼が言いたいんです！", "zh": "呃，这个嘛，之后再说……  \n总、总之，ROCO想向您道谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_025roc0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_025roc0194_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "efb59535c37ce52bd0f44d989e818c5b4a97b11ab2b06e545a68d36682975d81", "ja": "改めて、ベリーサンクスです♪　やっぱり\n{$P$}は、ロコの理解者ですね。", "zh": "再次向您表达very thanks♪　{$P$}果然\n很理解ROCO呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
